      "description": "<p>Sarah Khalifa, 39, charged with forming organised criminal gang to manufacture and traffic drugs</p><p>An Egyptian court sentenced a well-known television presenter and 11 others to death for manufacturing and trafficking narcotics in a sprawling drug case, official media reported on Saturday.</p><p>The presenter, Sarah Khalifa, 39, is best known for her programme Mission Impossible, which dealt with issues concerning security and crime.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/egyptian-tv-presenter-among-12-sentenced-to-death-for-drug\">Continue reading...</a>",
